/
/	MUL0 MULTIPLYS TWO 24BIT NUMBERS TOGETHER. OVERFLOW NOW PRODUCES A HALT.
/	ON ENTRY THE AC POINTS TO A LIST OF THREE ADDRESSES IN FIELD P.
/	THE ADDRESSES ARE OPERAND 1, OPERAND 2 AND THE RESULT.
/
MUL0,	0	/MULTIPLY TWO DP NUMBERS
	DCA ARGP	/AC HAS ARGLIST POINTER
	TAD I ARGP	/DF STILL P
	DCA M1	/FIRST ARG
	ISZ ARGP	/NEXT
	TAD I ARGP	/SECOND ARG
	DCA M2
	ISZ ARGP	/RESULT ADDRESS
	TAD I ARGP
	DCA RESP
	CLL CLA CMA RAL /-2
	DCA RESGN	/KEEP TRACK OF RESULT SIGN
	DLD
