/
/	DIV0 PERFORMS A 24 BIT BY 24 BIT DIVISION. ONLY THE INTEGER PART IS RETU
/	NED.	IN ORDER TO SPEED THINGS UP IT CHECKS THE RELATIVE SIZE
/	OF THE TWO OPERANDS AND JUMP TO THE FASTEST CODE.
/
DIV0,	0	/DIVIDE 24BITS SIGNED BY 24 BITS SIGNED
	DCA ARGP	/AC HAS POINTER TO ARG LIST.
	TAD I ARGP	/DF STILL P
	DCA DP	/DENOMINATOR
	ISZ ARGP
	TAD I ARGP
	DCA NP	/NUMORATOR
	ISZ ARGP
	TAD I ARGP
	DCA RESQ	/RESULT (QUOTIANT)
	CLL CLA CMA RAL /-2
	DCA RESGN	/SIGN OF RESULT
	DLD
