/
/	ONDECK IS LIKE A CHANEL ATTACH. IT BRINGS THE RELAVENT INFO
/
/	ABOUT A FILE ONTO PAGE ZERO. DEVICE 0 SHOULD BE DETECTED BEFORE
/	A CALL TO ONDECK. FIRST RETURN IS FATAL, SECOND IS OK.
/
ONDECK, 0	/GET INFO ABOUT A UNIT
	SWAB	/SAVE UNIT# IN MQ
	MQA
	SPA CLA	/MUST BE POSATIVE.
	JMP I ONDECK	/ERROR
	TAD CUR
	SAM	/COMPAIR
	SNA CLA	/DIFFERENT
	JMP NOWK	/ALREADY THERE
	TAD (12	/MAXIMUM UNIT # PLUS 1
	SAM
	SMA CLA	/10 SHOULD BE GREATER THAN ANY NUMBER
